 │                        │ ╭─ About this ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
 │ ○ Review               │ │ Telinha serves HTTPS on a port of its own and gets the certificate from Let's Encrypt   │
 │                        │ │ through your DuckDNS token: nothing to open on 80 or 443. Change it only if 8443 is     │
 │ ○ Install              │ │ already used on this machine.                                                           │
 │                        │ │                                                                                         │
 ╰────────────────────────╯ │ Your address: https://my-group.duckdns.org:8443                                         │
