 ╰────────────────────────╯ │ Good for a group of friends: Telinha runs on a  │
                            │ machine you already have.                       │
                            │                                                 │
                            │ Home internet connections usually do not let    │
                            │ the web ports 80 and 443 in, so Telinha does    │
                            │ not count on them. Next you pick how people     │
                            │ reach this machine: a Cloudflare Tunnel (if you │
                            │ have a domain on Cloudflare) or a free DuckDNS  │
                            │ …                                               │
